  epo:isSubjectToTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/6bc75979-ce6c-46eb-81a6-eee543697dec-01/AccessTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1SomeDocID1>,
